# Prod-only Studio & Builder

**Do not use `staging` or Hostinger `indobase.fun` as the default path.**

- Work and commit on **`main`**.
- When asked to push/deploy: `git push origin main`, wait for CI SHA tags, roll out on Vyom **`.249`** (`indobase.in`) per `.cursor/rules/indobase-prod-redeploy.mdc`.
- SHA image tags (not `:latest`). No force-push. Explicit user ask before commit/push/deploy.

| Branch | Environment | Hosts |
|--------|-------------|--------|
| **`main`** | Production | `studio.indobase.in`, `builder.indobase.in` (Vyom `.249`) |

Shared data plane stays on Vyom (`api.indobase.in`, `*.indobase.in` tenants).

## Do not

- Default to `staging` → `indobase.fun` / Hostinger `72.61.242.251`.
- Treat “deploy” as staging.
- Force-push `main` unless explicitly requested.

